WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.422 --> 00:00:03.605
Unit twenty-one. Conflict and Friendship!

2
00:00:04.511 --> 00:00:08.262
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.312 --> 00:00:11.450
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.313
Today we learn about Conflict and Friendship. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.586
Conflict. Say it with me. Conflict!

6
00:00:23.068 --> 00:00:26.968
Communication. Say it with me. Communication!

7
00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:33.567
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

8
00:00:37.032 --> 00:00:39.966
I-statement. Say it with me. I-statement!

9
00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:46.899
Compromise. Say it with me. Compromise!

10
00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:54.114
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

11
00:00:57.613 --> 00:01:01.147
Apology. Say it with me. Apology!

12
00:01:04.589 --> 00:01:07.372
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

13
00:01:10.887 --> 00:01:19.845
Conflict is normal in friendship. Stay calm, listen, and use an I-statement like 'I feel upset when...'. Good communication, compromise, and an apology rebuild respect.

14
00:01:19.895 --> 00:01:22.378
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.015 --> 00:01:28.945
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.995 --> 00:01:30.145
Listen!

17
00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:36.119
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.169 --> 00:01:37.319
Apology!

19
00:01:38.412 --> 00:01:44.527
Did you know? I-statements help people express feelings without blaming the other person!

20
00:01:44.577 --> 00:01:46.383
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.135 --> 00:01:54.662
Think and answer. Write an I-statement for a disagreement.

22
00:01:54.712 --> 00:01:55.862
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.126 --> 00:02:01.708
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.758 --> 00:02:04.416
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

